    "numbering":  "prober = the number the Windows Game Controllers panel shows (1-based). fsuipc = prober - 1, and 100 more when that is above 31 (FSUIPC7 User Guide; checked on a Bravo: panel 33 = FSUIPC 132). A hat is not a button: its entries carry hat (the direction) and fsuipc from the FSUIPC7 User Guide rule, POV = buttons 32 (forward) to 39 clockwise, marked assumed until a FSUIPC7.log line has shown it."
